ncerely Yours Indra.","title":"會議結論","id":773,]),(["poster":"Ishige","time":821699048,"body":"hi all:	after final exam ..i will modify all island's weapon	so ...please wait me ......				ishige","title":"about island's weapon","id":774,]),(["poster":"Mad","time":821701492,"body":"今天搞了四個多小時才把硬碟搞定:終於可以讓 WIN3.1C && WORD6.0C && 印表機都能動起來 :~~~~~可是報告還沒打, 也還沒準備念考試要考的東東 :P........................................................................I must be mad, I will kill you two times.","title":"< no title >","id":775,]),(["poster":"Indra","time":821705276,"title":"< no title >","body":" 我明天要上臺報告 Fuzzy control .     可是 paper 沒寫. 要說的沒印.     要講的沒看....:~~~","id":776,]),})
